d in soft neutral tones with warm accent hues: the floor is a light beige wood finish, walls and ceiling are crisp white with subtle texture; bed linens feature muted taupe and blush pink accents on pillows and duvet; nightstands and dresser have matte off-white lacquer surfaces accented by small copper-toned handles or hardware. The large wardrobe has clean vertical paneling in dove gray with integrated recessed lighting above shelves. A sleek black-framed chair sits near sliding glass doors that frame lush greenery outside, while the floating console table holds ceramic vases in terracotta orange and sage green—both serving as bold textural anchors against monochrome interiors. Ambient LED strips along crown molding cast gentle gold highlights across ceilings and wall niches, enhancing depth without glare. Decorative frames lean slightly asymmetrical atop cabinets, their edges softened into cream-colored matting for visual harmony. All metallic fixtures glow faintly rose-gold under indirect backlighting, completing an airy yet richly layered aesthetic where color remains restrained but intentional—a curated palette of earthy warmth punctuated by organic material textures like linen drapes, cork-backed furniture legs, and polished concrete countertops subtly visible beneath shelving units."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 680, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 364, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "1.2.5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [694], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["您是一位专业的视觉风格转换专家，专注于建筑设计场景中的视觉风格迁移，尤其注重色彩材质与风格方案的传递。您的任务是将两个输入图像进行深度融合：严格遵循左边图像的空间结构与物件布局，并全面应用空间参考图的视觉风格，其中色彩迁移是核心重点。\n\n原图：定义空间结构、布局、构图与物件位置\n\n风格参考图：定义视觉风格，尤其包括色彩方案，同时涵盖场景材质、主产品材料、装饰元素与氛围照明，重点描述风格参考图中的亮眼的材质，尤其是除了主要基础材质和颜色以外的其他主要的颜色和材质的部分，尤其是有彩色系的时候，强调点缀元素或有代表性的元素\n\n您的输出必须完全保持原图中的空间结构、房间形态、门窗位置、家具布局及建筑细节，同时彻底避免任何对混凝土材质或人物的提及。\n需将空间参考图中的视觉风格——尤其是色彩搭配、颜色情绪与色调过渡——无缝且主导性地融合到原图所定义的结构中，确保色彩效果显著、明确。\n\n关键要求：\n\n禁止使用原图中的任何原始色彩或风格相关表述\n\n必须以空间参考图中的色彩方案为核心对原图进行风格渲染，明确描述白膜图的渲染主色、材质及色彩氛围还有风格\n\n聚焦于可见的物理属性，尤其精确描述色彩表现\n\n语言清晰具体，适于图像生成模型理解\n\n只输出一个自然、流畅的英文描述，描述原图按照风格参考图的配色进行重新上色渲染的场景，不包含任何解释或额外注释\n\n以下为原图的描述和原图加风格参考图的拼图，严格禁止直接提到风格参考图中的任何内容，简单描述描述原图按照风格参考图的配色材质和风格重绘的效果即可："], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [684.0916748046875, 522.7828979492188], "pos": [576.8530883789062, 3897.035888671875], "id": 347, "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-node-suite-comfyui", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "ea935d1044ae5a26efa54ebeb18fe9020af49a45", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [703], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [315, 178], "pos": [749.959716796875, 3884.789794921875], "widgets_values": [", ", "true"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "text_a", "link": 694, "label": "text_a", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_a"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_b", "link": 731, "label": "text_b", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_b"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text_c", "label": "text_c", "type": "STRING", "locali